      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'During October-November, with the apparent movement of the sun towards
    the south, the monsoon trough or the low-pressure trough over the northern plains
    becomes weaker. This is gradually replaced by a high-pressure system. The south-west
    monsoon winds weaken and start withdrawing gradually. By the beginning of October,
    the monsoon withdraws from the Northern Plains. '
